SUMMARY:LAW OF ATTRACTION: (Live a Life with Greater Peace\, Joy and Purpo
 se)
DESCRIPTION:Try New Things in Toronto!\nHello everyone\,\n\nPlease join us
  for an inspiring\, interactive and insightful afternoon as we continue to
  move closer to living the life we wish to live using the amazing and mira
 culous **Law of Attraction.**\n\nWe're going to have a lot of fun too!\n\n
 \\*Joined by my other personal growth and social groups too\; so we can an
 ticipate a terrific turn out\, with wonderful like minded people\n\n**Date
 :**\nSunday\, May 10th\, 2026\n**Arrival Time:**\nArrive between 4:00 pm a
 nd 4:30 pm\n**Where to Meet us?**\n**Location: La Carnita - Good Fortune B
 ar (Main Floor)**\n**Address:** 130 Eglinton Ave. Toronto\, ON M4P 2X9\n**
 Free Parking:** on Eglinton and Residential area\n**Yonge and Eglinton Sub
 way:** (Very close\, 3 minute walking distance)\n\nEvent Details below:\n\
 nSincerely\,\n\nSteve Flemming\n(Organizer/Host)\n\n\\-\\-\\-\nEvent Detai
 ls:\n**LAW OF ATTRACTION: (Live a Life with Greater Peace\, Joy and Purpos
 e)**\n\n-Take your life to the next level with increased clarity\, joy\, f
 ulfillment\, abundance and peace\n-Deepen your understanding on how to app
 ly the **Law of Attraction** so it works in all areas of your life (Person
 al\, Professional\, Social & Romantic)\n-Develop your confidence and sense
  of self so you are more open to receive what the universe wants to give y
 ou\n-Tap into your inner source of passions\, talents and creativity that 
 will guide you to a life beyond your wildest imagination *(And then ask th
 e Universe for even more!)*\n\n\\*Interactive\, inspiring and insightful a
 fternoon designed to help you live the life you truly desire and truly des
 erve to live (with greater flow\, energy\, ease and purpose)\n\n\\*This ev
 ent will be effectively facilitated with powerful insights\, useful tools\
 , practical exercises and group participation\n\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\
 \-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n***Our Instructor/Facilitator:***\
 n**Steve Flemming** is the founder of **Soul City Social Club since 2006.*
 * He produces monthly events on subjects involving personal/spiritual grow
 th\, modern dating and healthy relationships while incorporating the **Law
  of Attraction and other useful tools.** Each event is designed to help yo
 u experience greater joy\, inner peace\, confidence\, fulfillment\, love\,
  meaning and aliveness in our lives. Steve is a professional group Facilit
 ator and Inspirational Speaker. Steve has an ongoing passion to help shift
  people's lives and consciousness for the better in areas that matter most
  to you.\nhttps://www.meetup.com/SoulCity/\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-
 \\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\
 -\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n**When to a
 rrive: (Ask for Steve when you arrive-or head to back area)**\n-Please arr
 ive between 4:00 pm and 4:30 pm (to get registered and settled in)\n-The f
 ormal part of the afternoon will start shortly after 4:30 p.m. and go unti
 l roughly 6:30 p.m.\n-Stick around after for more mingling and our dinner 
 party (optional)\n\\*no extra charge for attending the dinner party event\
 n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\
 \-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-
 \\-\\-\\-\n\n**Event Fee:** 10 dollars upon arrival (HST included)\n(Cash 
 only when you arrive or in advance by e transfer to- steveflemming11@gmail
 .com\n\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\n\\*Lunch/Dinner & Beverage Menu available too\n\\*In
 cludes reserved seating for the group\n\\*At least one Beverage and/or app
 etizer minimum to support the staff and venue\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-
 \\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n**Parking Available:**\n\\*Ple
 nty of free street parking on Eglinton and (Residential area south/east of
  venue for free)\n**Close to Subway Station:**\n\\*Also very close to the 
 the Yonge/Eglinton subway station\n\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\
 \-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-
